d all squirrels are skittish, Rock cannot be a squirrel.\n   - Thus, Rock must be cute (because it is not a squirrel and all rabbits are cute).\n\n6. **Conclusion:**\n   - The conclusion "Rock is either cute or skittish" is true based on the given information.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is:\n\\boxed{A}\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
