ased on the given information, the statement "Tom is a grumpy person" is uncertain because we do not have enough information to definitively say whether Tom is grumpy or not. The information only tells us that Tom is nice to animals, but it does not provide any direct information about his grumpiness.\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
