ince Marvin is an extraterrestrial, he cannot be a human (as no extraterrestrial is human).\n\nTherefore, Marvin is neither a human nor from Mars.\n\nBased on the given information, the statement "Marvin is neither a human nor from Mars" is true.\n\n<｜User｜>Please solve the logical reasoning problem. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
