and Coco Gauff:**\n   - Since all female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 lost to Iga Świątek, and everyone who lost to Iga Świątek is ranked highly by the WTA, it follows that all female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 are ranked highly by the WTA.\n   - Therefore, Coco Gauff, who is among the female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022, is ranked highly by the WTA.\n\n3. **Analyze the information about Coco Gauff and Rafael Nadal:**\n   - Since all male tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 lost to Rafael Nadal, and Coco Gauff is not a male tennis player at Roland Garros 2022 (as per the given information), it follows that Coco Gauff did not lose to Rafael Nadal.\n\n4. **Conclusion:**\n   - Since Coco Gauff is ranked highly by the WTA and did not lose to Rafael Nadal, she meets the criteria to be among the most active players in major tennis.\n\nTherefore, the statement "Coco Gauff is among the most active players in major tennis" is true.\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
