es was translated from Italian.\n\n<｜User｜>Based on the above information, is the following statement true, false, or uncertain? Palace of Flies was translated from Italian.\n# Options:.\nA) True.\nB) False.\nC) Uncertain.\n<｜Assistant｜>. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
