and Garros 2022 lost to Iga Świątek, and everyone who lost to Iga Świątek is ranked highly by the WTA, it follows that all female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 are ranked highly by the WTA.\n   - Therefore, Coco Gauff, being a female tennis player at Roland Garros 2022, is ranked highly by the WTA.\n   - According to the given information, if Coco Gauff is ranked highly by the WTA or a player who lost to Rafael Nadal, then Coco Gauff is not a male tennis player at Roland Garros 2022. Since Coco Gauff is ranked highly by the WTA, this condition is satisfied, and thus Coco Gauff is not a male tennis player at Roland Garros 2022.\n\n3. **Conclusion:**.\n   - Since Coco Gauff is not a male tennis player at Roland Garros 2022, she cannot be one of the most active players in major tennis (as the question asks about players who lost to Iga Świątek or one of the most active players in major tennis).\n   - Therefore, the statement "Coco Gauff is not a player who lost to Iga Świątek or one of the most active players in major tennis" is true.\n\n<｜User｜>Based on the above information, is the following statement true, false, or uncertain? Coco Gauff is not a player who lost to Iga Świątek or one of the most active players in major tennis.\n# Options:. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
