o be used for training the text summarization model.\n\n4. **Conclusion:**.\n   - Since supervised learning is the only type of machine learning algorithm mentioned for training the text summarization model, and it is the only one that fits the criteria of being used for training, the statement "Supervised learning is used to train the state-of-the-art text summarization model" is true.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is:. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
