g, and a person either studies or teaches (from statement 3), Jerry cannot be teaching.\n- Since Jerry is not teaching, and no young person teaches (from statement 4), Jerry cannot be young.\n\nBased on the logical relationships and the given information, the statement "Jerry is young" is false.\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
